      "message": "I think this can be changed to `std::pair\u003cvoid*, BindBufferInfo\u003e`, and then we can call `map_offset` and `info-\u003egetMappableBuffer()` inside this function instead of repeating the logic several times at the call sites.\n\nThe callers can just check `std::get\u003c0\u003e(pair)` for null to see if the prepare was successful and then wrap it in a XWriter. We don\u0027t need to wrap BindBufferInfo in a std::optional since its defualt value of `{null, 0}` is sufficient to describe the failed prepare as well.",
